  "content": "```html\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbetterdogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c93b172f-e281-4d3c-823a-400a3f2c4287.png\" width=\"781\" height=\"130\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqzvDFF.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"255\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此頁面也提供獨立版本（請往下滾動）</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用前請閱讀<br>此資源包支援 Minecraft 1.21.4 及以下版本，最低至 1.8.9 版。<br></strong>此資源包需要 <strong>Optifine</strong>（Forge）或 <strong>EMF + ETF</strong>（Forge/Fabric）或 <strong>CEM + Puzzle</strong>（Fabric）才能運行。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示：</strong>若使用 <strong>EMF + ETF</strong> 或 <strong>CEM + Puzzle</strong>，請參閱下方隱藏內容中列出的必要模組。</p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>備註 1：在 Fabric 上使用此資源包可能會導致某些狗模型出現輕微錯誤。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><br>備註 2：部分基礎功能可能略有問題，但可透過以下方法修復：<br>馴服狼或為已馴服的狼使用支援的名牌後，按下 <strong>F3 + T</strong> 即可在遊戲中顯示狗品種。</em>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">___</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>讓 Better Dog 資源包在 Fabric/Sodium 上運行所需的模組如下。所有模組皆須放入 minecraft 的 mods 資料夾。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重要事項：</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp;</span>請確保所有模組與您的 Fabric 版本相符。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric（CEM + Puzzle (Fabric) 的必要條件）</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>必要模組（EMF + ETF (Forge/Fabric)）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（適用於 Minecraft 1.20.1 - 1.19.3 版本）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Entity Model Features</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API<br><br></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>必要模組（CEM + Puzzle (Fabric)）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（適用於 Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要！</strong> 適用於 Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本的模組需設定以下配置：&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fF8e45wQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/F8e45wQ</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-entity-models-cem/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Custom Entity Models (CEM)</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cloth Config API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/completeconfig/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CompleteConfig</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Puzzle</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><strong>可選（非必要但強烈建議以提升 FPS）：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Phosphor</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;（若遇到問題，請閱讀下方說明）&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kOcFo9u.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"1301\"><br>所有品種的遊戲內截圖：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YpK30pq.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yfiBnIR.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"648\"></strong></p><p><strong>指南 - 新增自訂名牌：<br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>本簡短指南將以黃金獵犬為例新增自訂名牌：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1）</strong>前往 Minecraft 資源包資料夾（%appdata% &gt; .minecraft &gt; resourcepacks）。<br><br><strong>2）</strong>開啟您正在使用的 Better Dogs 資源包版本。<br><br><strong>3）</strong>導覽至 assets/minecraft/Optifine/mob/wolf。<br><br><strong>4）</strong>使用 Notepad++ 或類似文字編輯工具開啟 <em>wolf_tame.properties</em> 檔案。<br><br><strong>5）</strong>按下 Ctrl + F，輸入您想新增自訂名稱的品種（此範例中使用<strong><em>黃金獵犬</em></strong>）。<br><br><strong>6）</strong>檔案會跳到以下幾行：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1<br><br></em><strong>7）</strong>下一行顯示目前支援的名牌：<br><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><br><strong>8）</strong>我們要新增自訂名稱「Mike wazowski」。使用「&nbsp;<strong>| 」</strong>符號與其他名稱區隔：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden|Mike wazowski).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1</em><br><strong><br>9）</strong>覆蓋目前的 <em>wolf_tame.properties</em> 檔案。自訂名稱「<em>Mike wazowski</em>」現在已受支援。<br>（若在遊戲中修改這些檔案，請同時按下 F3 + T 重新整理啟用的資源包）。<br><br><strong>注意事項：<br>- </strong>本指南適用於所有品種，不限於黃金獵犬。<br>- 使用此資源包的其他玩家在您使用自訂新增的名牌時，不會看到相同的品種，除非他們也執行相同步驟並新增相同的名稱。<br><br></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">獨立版本<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dGHLWnb.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>這些獨立版本對 FPS 的影響較小<br>（點擊下載按鈕進行下載）</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-wolves/download/3694826/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dX1qDDo.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3511701\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZqR1DL.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3514180\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BL2vsG7.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3528488\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJ0IpsX.png\" alt=\"巴哥犬\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3550731\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DfJy58p.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3738097\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9jI6XTt.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3916688\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83jqNGr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3516155\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cO3jR0v.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3648293\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDzUPmk.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ayukpXn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/download/3550731/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpM1xYP.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>（點擊下載按鈕進行下載）</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-cats-curseforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xe1adNG.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-farm-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aHEmv8l.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3536286\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7KHrHw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pet-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I9AzCyY.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jPEH6of.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JWbz8eY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong>（僅限 Optifine）<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NDszZji.gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3ajCdNW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOcnVCF.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DsCy47K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong></p>\n<p>逐步指南請見：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fVmO4MHx\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>已知不相容模組清單：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Xaero's minimap：</strong> 導致狗/狼的頭部浮空。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>對資源包友善的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revamped wolf：</strong> 導致模型看起來像繩子。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>對資源包友善的替代方案：無。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doggy talents：</strong> 導致模型看起來像繩子。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>對資源包友善的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next</a></p>\n</div><p><strong>致謝</strong></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffrancielly%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Francy_Chan</a> 製作了此資源包 <strong><em>Better dogs V1.2（附項圈）</em></strong> 版本中的項圈，並協助我理解名牌的運作方式。</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/egoist1372/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EGOIST1372</a> 協助我找出如何讓此資源包與 Sodium-Fabric 相容。</li>\n<li>此頁面上使用的自訂字型由 codeman38 製作。</li>\n<li>此資源包特殊版本中使用的音效由 Hot Ideas Inc. 和 Zapsplat 製作。</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未經我的許可，請勿上傳此資源包。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>若在 YouTube 影片中使用此資源包，請在影片說明中附上此資源包的連結。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是我的嗜好，但捐贈將由衷感謝！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrblueyetimc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1192828/description_cd73d6ea-5748-4aa7-9037-23e12d5be3c4.webp\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>現任及前任 Patreon 贊助者清單</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">衷心感謝所有贊助者！</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Heyhay13 - 小雞級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Nqobie - 小雞級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Rinzler - 小雞級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>以及其他八位慷慨的匿名贊助者</strong></li>\n</ul>\n```<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iFbDq72.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/WszQzsB\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MdEY9Xj\" alt=\"\"></p>",
